content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Architect",
      "description": "Professional who creates conceptual designs and refines building plans"
    },
    {
      "name": "Conceptual Design",
      "description": "Early design representation capturing the vision for a building"
    },
    {
      "name": "Feedback",
      "description": "Input provided to improve or adjust a design"
    },
    {
      "name": "Project Manager",
      "description": "Person responsible for coordinating timelines and project activities"
    },
    {
      "name": "Project Timeline",
      "description": "Schedule outlining key design and submission deadlines"
    },
    {
      "name": "Permit",
      "description": "Authorization required from authorities for project approval"
    },
    {
      "name": "Draftsperson",
      "description": "Specialist who produces technical drawings and floor plans"
    },
    {
      "name": "Technical Draft",
      "description": "Detailed technical drawing derived from conceptual designs"
    },
    {
      "name": "Review",
      "description": "Evaluation process of design drafts for quality and accuracy"
    },
    {
      "name": "Client Relations Specialist",
      "description": "Role responsible for gathering requirements and communicating with clients"
    },
    {
      "name": "Requirement Documentation",
      "description": "Collection of a client’s needs and preferences for the project"
    },
    {
      "name": "Client",
      "description": "Person who provides requirements and approves final project designs"
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Client Requests": {
      "objects": [
        "Client",
        "Client Relations Specialist",
        "Requirement Documentation"
      ]
    },
    "Technical Drafting": {
      "objects": [
        "Draftsperson",
        "Technical Draft",
        "Review"
      ]
    },
    "Conceptualization": {
      "objects": [
        "Architect",
        "Conceptual Design",
        "Feedback"
      ]
    },
    "Project Management": {
      "objects": [
        "Project Manager",
        "Project Timeline",
        "Permit"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- In case an object appears in multiple bounded contexts, suggest a name change.
- Also suggest a name change if the meaning of the object is too similar to an object from another bounded context
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Client Requests": {
      "derived from": "Client Requests Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Client",
        "Client Relations Specialist",
        "Requirement Documentation"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Technical Drafting": {
      "derived from": "Technical Drafting Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Draftsperson",
        "Technical Draft",
        "Draft Review"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Review -> Draft Review"
      ]
    },
    "Conceptualization": {
      "derived from": "Conceptualization Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Architect",
        "Conceptual Design",
        "Concept Feedback"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Feedback -> Concept Feedback"
      ]
    },
    "Project Management": {
      "derived from": "Project Management Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Project Manager",
        "Project Timeline",
        "Permit"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    }
  }
}
```
